{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":14821088,"ns":0,"title":"Compliant mechanism","extract":"In mechanical engineering, a compliant mechanism is a flexible mechanism that achieves force and motion transmission through elastic body deformation. It gains some or all of its motion from the relative flexibility of its members rather than from rigid-body joints alone.","description":"Mechanism which transmits force through elastic body deformation","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}